h: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) 14:00~18:00</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 1pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">테스트 기간 운영 목적 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -11.6pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">정식 수강신청 기간에 오류 발생을 최소화하고 학생 불편사항 발생 예방 목적으로 테스트 기간 운영</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -16.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -16.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">3. 3. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">테스트 기간 운영 방법</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">수강신청시스템 테스트 기간 전에 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">수강지도 상담 승인을 받은 학생들이 직접 수강신청시스템에서 수강신청</span><s